#### Required firmware/bootloader

Your firmware/OS must be on _**April 2025** or **older**_!

{{< callout type="error" emoji="⚠️" >}}
**IMPORTANT NOTICE**

If your current firmware is on **May 2025 or _later_** you can **NOT** flash AXP.OS - **A13** builds! This is due to a rollback implementation by Google **which will lead to a hard-brick** on these devices!
If you are not sure, request support **before** flashing!
[Details](https://developers.google.com/android/images#special_instructions_for_updating_pixel_devices_to_the_may_2025_monthly_release)
{{< /callout >}}

If you are **100% sure** your device met the above requirements follow the regular _Install (Pixel devices)_ guide:
